<title>MOLDOVA: TABLE-Moldovan leu edges down to 4.564 per dollar.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Moldovan leu edges down to 4.564 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu edged down to 4.564 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.5618 on Aug 1.</p>
<p>				   Aug 5	Aug 5</p>
<p> lei per dollar		4.564	4.5618</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	   150,000    100,000</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
